cell text 4 (level 1): Names only one of the episode and the condition, or names two without saying which is which.
cell text 3 (level 2): Names both the episode and the condition, says which is the episode and which the condition; a date or a locator is missing for one or both of them.
cell text 2 (level 3): Names both the episode and the condition with dates, says which is the episode and which the condition, and gives at least one locator for each of the two.
cell text 1 (level 4): Names both the episode and the condition with dates, says which is the episode and which the condition, and gives a locator for each date (a page, a table, a section, the title field of a source, or a MANIFEST row).
